{"listing_id":"54070824","snapshot":"2026-06-29","corpus_reviews":20,"corpus_dates":["2022-01-12","2024-07-17"],"selected_reviews":20,"selection":"time_only_v0","purposive_review_ids":[]}
{"review_id":"538287967641507171","date":"2022-01-12","comment":"Great property, communication was simple and easy. Warm cosy feeling and very modern. I recommend this property and service to everyone :)!"}
{"review_id":"541123711376532719","date":"2022-01-16","comment":"We were blown away as soon as we walked in, we all kept saying wow!\nI had the best 25th birthday with my friends! The house was perfect! Especially the colour theme and aesthetics made it even better\nThe reply was rapid and we had access to the host at all times, we had shower equipments and lots in the kitchen and snacks given to us.\nThe house has led lights all over and make it even more special!"}
{"review_id":"551236418460891017","date":"2022-01-30","comment":"The house was absolutely beautiful. Modern and spacious in a great location. 10/10"}
{"review_id":"551961296376595676","date":"2022-01-31","comment":"My family and I enjoyed staying at your house. It’s the best Manchester. Very clean spacious, new and modern. We will definitely come back anytime we’re in Manchester"}
{"review_id":"556401407933541194","date":"2022-02-06","comment":"The place was spotless and everything was as described. Great amenities and Nyerovwo was accommodating and replied quick to any questions. Had a great stay and would recommend!"}
{"review_id":"562122934469419267","date":"2022-02-14","comment":"Had a lovely weekend staying here, great location just outside the city centre and the lights in the house create a fantastic vibe. I would highly recommend staying here ."}
{"review_id":"566119643919655901","date":"2022-02-19","comment":"Terrible host cancelled booking on the day at 1:50 am left us stranded for the day in Manchester on a busy weekend we’re everything was fully booked. Very very disappointed air BnB allow this to happen"}
{"review_id":"571559300287938424","date":"2022-02-27","comment":"Pretty good spot if you are heading to the Manchester area"}
{"review_id":"591852413630554006","date":"2022-03-27","comment":"Amazing and understanding"}
{"review_id":"596897838920739722","date":"2022-04-03","comment":"Perfect house for a trip to Manchester. Ideally located for city centre. Very clean, modern and bright. Attentive host who is very helpful and accommodating."}
{"review_id":"622326576835324158","date":"2022-05-08","comment":"Amazing apartment. Clean, accessible to the city centre and overall good communication from the host. No faults"}
{"review_id":"640415093720994443","date":"2022-06-02","comment":"We really enjoyed our stay. The house was very clean, and had everything we could needed. The check in and communication with the host was very easy!"}
{"review_id":"648409522106345980","date":"2022-06-13","comment":"Lovely property, very clean, modern and very comfortable!"}
{"review_id":"650526696383979427","date":"2022-06-16","comment":"Great place to stay. Very clean and well presented.\nOnly minutes to walk\nTo the nearest tram stop for links all over Manchester."}
{"review_id":"718666606839203153","date":"2022-09-18","comment":"This air bnb was perfect for a birthday weekend away. Only a taxi ride away from the centre, house is lovely, clean and modern with comfy beds and all amenities you can think of included. Would definitely stay here again! ☺️"}
{"review_id":"754266834455173052","date":"2022-11-06","comment":"Nice weekend at this property which had everything we required"}
{"review_id":"886128654684920007","date":"2023-05-07","comment":"Clean, spacious house. Host is attentive & instructions are clear!\nDecent location if you want to stay a little out of the city, but still easily accessible. Would recommend"}
{"review_id":"901359629546576706","date":"2023-05-28","comment":"Really clean and spacious house.Easy walk to tram stop and about 25/30 mins in to the centre.\nEasy check in and great communication from Nyerovwo.We needed a couple of extra things when we arrived and he was very quick to reply and sort out.Very helpful.\nLittle welcome pack too.\nLocal supermarket too.\nWe had a fab weekend in a great house."}
{"review_id":"926724194581670587","date":"2023-07-02","comment":"place was nice, living room was lovely, no garden furniture."}
{"review_id":"1202836667476853223","date":"2024-07-17","comment":"Vey neat, i would recommend. The property was very neat and modern. Host very helpful"}

