{"listing_id":"22551754","snapshot":"2026-06-29","corpus_reviews":19,"corpus_dates":["2018-03-01","2024-06-09"],"selected_reviews":19,"selection":"time_only_v0","purposive_review_ids":[]}
{"review_id":"239338761","date":"2018-03-01","comment":"Eddie was a fantastic host!, he has a wonderful home with a beautiful view and he is very nice and clean. After spending one month together at his place we became really good friends. He helped us with everything that he could and he even baught for us many bakewal slices :) . Hope to meet him again soon!. We really recommend broadbottom and his house as a peaceful and comfy place to stay :) .\nMeli and Ludo <3 <3"}
{"review_id":"256219623","date":"2018-04-22","comment":"Edward is a very friendly host, making me feel at home straight away. The bed is very comfortable and everywhere is clean and tidy. The area is very beautiful, quiet and peaceful, great for walks and hikes. I would recommend a stay with Edward."}
{"review_id":"744095897409648626","date":"2022-10-23","comment":"The room is spacious and the view from the kitchen is really beautiful. Nice and quite environnement. Eddie is quite chilled out, helpful and easy to talk to."}
{"review_id":"749829895385857336","date":"2022-10-31","comment":"Come back again after a trip to Edinburgh. Very quiet and peaceful location. We could enjoy our privacy. Eddie is helpful and quick to respond. Nice place to stay."}
{"review_id":"770906992295609600","date":"2022-11-29","comment":"Eddie is an amazing host. Very friend and responsive. Always giving us privacy and recommendations on where to visit. And always responsive when we needed help. The view from the house is breathtaking. Good place to stay and relax."}
{"review_id":"835404983507005927","date":"2023-02-26","comment":"Returning again. Eddie is great and kind host. Very flexible check in time. Will recommend to people who visit the area"}
{"review_id":"866586358850259299","date":"2023-04-10","comment":"The room is described as having fantastic views, but in fact the views are from the kitchen, not the double room. This should be made more clear. The bedroom is large and clean, and the bed is comfy. Edward is a friendly and helpful host, we appreciated his advice about walking routes in the area."}
{"review_id":"868691925229359007","date":"2023-04-13","comment":"We loved this placed. Massive room, comfy, brand new bathroom all to ourselves. Great views....great host..thanks :-)"}
{"review_id":"873029832519650899","date":"2023-04-19","comment":"Great place, great location, great host. Spot on!"}
{"review_id":"877405886476265155","date":"2023-04-25","comment":"Nice, spacious room in a beautiful location, plus the train into Manchester only takes 20 minutes if needed. Eddie was really accommodating and helpful, would definitely recommend!"}
{"review_id":"880283381458043431","date":"2023-04-29","comment":"Edward was very helpful and made sure my stay was comfortable. He has a really nice place and a super friendly 🐶 . 5 star ."}
{"review_id":"902011824563577525","date":"2023-05-29","comment":"Eddie was so helpful and friendly. Communication skills are very good.He responded quickly to my enquiries and checked in with us a couple of days before we were due to stay with him. We were delighted Ed was able to accept our baggage and give us a key in the morning as going to a music festival we knew we would not be back till late.\nThe room itself is large and airy with a very comfortable bed and pillows. The bathroom is not ensuite but nearby on the same floor, so private. We used everything we needed in the kitchen upstairs where there is the most magnificent view. If you have time there is also a lovely garden area to sit in or laze in a hammock.\nIt was a spendid overnight stay , thank you ever so much."}
{"review_id":"911430636898682778","date":"2023-06-11","comment":"Wonderful host, thank you!\nI might be back next year at next years competition :)"}
{"review_id":"920216133948468845","date":"2023-06-23","comment":"Really got on well with Edward a very friendly guy, we loved his dog. The location was very good for us as we could walk to our friends house easily.\nThanks for letting us use your space. Tim & sue"}
{"review_id":"920878091577641307","date":"2023-06-24","comment":"Edward was the friendliest of hosts! Very nice to hang out with and clearly a naturally gifted airbnb host 😀 the room was spacious and clean and the whole house was lovely."}
{"review_id":"950598536213941124","date":"2023-08-04","comment":"Edward’s place is a peaceful sanctuary on the edge of the beautiful Peak District.\nThe room is large and extremely comfortable with a recently renovated, modern bathroom.\nEdward was on hand to assist us on arrival and provided useful information about the services in the surrounding area.\nThis was an ideal overnight stay for us, but would suit a longer stay for anyone seeking a relaxing, tranquil break in the countryside.\nThanks Eddie!"}
{"review_id":"1057901591357635090","date":"2023-12-30","comment":"Impressed by Edward‘s exceptional responsibility and patience. He responded promptly to our requests and questions, making our stay stress-free."}
{"review_id":"1160028936564232818","date":"2024-05-19","comment":"Thankyou so much for hosting us although our trip was cut short there was everything we needed for a night meeting family in glossop.\nEdward is a very responsive host, nothing was too much trouble.\nEven down to the extra questions I had regarding the amazing flowers he has in the front garden 🙂 Thanks again."}
{"review_id":"1175249597824690239","date":"2024-06-09","comment":"Eddie's place was extremely comfortable and was exactly as described. His tips were useful and check-in instructions easy to follow. Highly recommended!"}

