{"review_id":"367708574","date":"2019-01-05","comment":"Such a great location. Nice and clean and cool place. Lovely staff at checking so friendly and helpful. Cafe downstairs for breakfast etc perfect for a short stay as we were flying the next day! Really comfy bed too"}
