{"review_id":"542285433","date":"2019-10-06","comment":"5 star rating on This place could not fault anything\nI will be staying here again for sure"}
{"review_id":"596660074","date":"2020-01-23","comment":"Absolutely amazing place, with the most comfortable bed I’ve ever slept in! Super stylish. Our apartment didn’t have an oven which was slightly disappointing, however we only stayed one night so it wasn’t really a problem. Would 100% recommend!!"}
{"review_id":"602980532","date":"2020-02-08","comment":"The hotel was very friendly and beautifully decorated. They were very kind when my phone charger did not fit the wall plugs."}
{"review_id":"605009570","date":"2020-02-13","comment":"Amazing place to stay if you're in Manchester. Loved the apartment so much I wanted to move in. Lots of relaxed space downstairs as well if you're an earlier riser than your roomie. Don't try to have a bath after midnight though: I didn't turn into a Gremlin (showing my age...) but there wasn't enough hot water at that time. Overall, just perfect though. Very friendly staff, 24 hour reception, great location and a discount at the NCP next door so just head there if you arrive earlier!"}
{"review_id":"613600601","date":"2020-03-02","comment":"Much bigger apartment complex than expected but the cosy touches and stylish decor were just like the pictures. Excellent service and really friendly staff. :-)"}
