{"review_id":"664282570","date":"2020-09-14","comment":"Do not pass go or you may end up in jail. A fantastic residence with class. Beautiful architectural surroundings by a very famous architect. Very central for Restaurant’s cafes and bars.\nA must visit to Perdu Peru. The in house restaurant which is outstanding and the fantastic atmosphere! The bar excellent with Kiko the head bar man and his espresso martinis that are to die for."}
{"review_id":"664598234","date":"2020-09-15","comment":"Lovely staff and very nice interior :) !"}
{"review_id":"669005811","date":"2020-09-28","comment":"Lovely room, good vibe and excellent location. Will be back for sure! =)"}
{"review_id":"702287845","date":"2020-10-20","comment":"very chic and clean, loads of thoughtful little touches ! Complimentary fancy snack in the room and coffee that wasn't instant coffee."}
{"review_id":"740846869","date":"2021-03-21","comment":"很棒，"}
