{"review_id":"485353211159450076","date":"2021-10-31","comment":"Great location on canal st’s doorstep, good parking rates, stylish & classy accommodation. Helpful staff too. It does get noisy but to be expected given the central location and it shouldn’t stop you sleeping well."}
{"review_id":"570176955561688349","date":"2022-02-25","comment":"Absolutely amazing stay, we loved our room and didn’t want to leave once we got there, would recommend to anyone."}
