{"review_id":"597696470278537698","date":"2022-04-04","comment":"Cool room, lovely decor and great facilities. Nice and central, easy to walk in the centre. Nice cafe for breakfast in the morning and cool attached restaurant."}
{"review_id":"641157045303909865","date":"2022-06-03","comment":"Everything about it is top tier"}
