{"review_id":"873828010922467260","date":"2023-04-20","comment":"Fantastic stay.\nClose to all city attractions.\nFriendly and helpful staff.\nStudio spotless with everything you could possibly need.\nWe will definitely return and highly recommend"}
{"review_id":"892565843718450712","date":"2023-05-16","comment":"Great location, really cool vibe + good amenities. Would definitely recommend!"}
{"review_id":"907129158494696750","date":"2023-06-05","comment":"Gorgeous apartment, lovely stay x"}
