{"review_id":"1014372281820177843","date":"2023-10-31","comment":"Lovely place to stay for any amount of time, lovely hosts and a short walk to some amazing places to eat or drink, 100% recommended."}
{"review_id":"1099269861813479657","date":"2024-02-25","comment":"absolutely no problems... nice clean and well equipped apartment, great location, friendly staff..."}
{"review_id":"1120197790348684546","date":"2024-03-25","comment":"Very accommodating and kind! Beautiful place and location!"}
{"review_id":"1143396369617430845","date":"2024-04-26","comment":"Mint"}
{"review_id":"1148490519506859189","date":"2024-05-03","comment":"Really nice hotel aesthetically, clean, everything you need onsite and great location. I would have been very happy with my stay but had one issue which I felt wasn’t dealt with very professionally.\nI booked for 2 adults and one dog. Host messaged asking me to add my dog to the booking, I explained I already had and nothing else was said. To then arrive and be told the dog fee is £40. This is an extremely high fee and I feel it needs to be clearer at the point of booking. The staff showed no empathy about the situation, I was told ‘that’s the risk you take going through a 3rd party’ and if I had booked through their website the fee would have been clearer. I appreciate there probably wasn’t a lot they could do about the actual fee but their responses made things worse.\nThankfully when checking out the woman on reception was so lovely and somewhat redeemed the situation by being genuinely apologetic and assured she would feed it back so the fee on Air B&B is made more clear."}
{"review_id":"1155738586466926514","date":"2024-05-13","comment":"Everyone was so kind & attentive! Felt very welcome, even though you have pictures you can’t really know until it’s in person. It was super lovely and I don’t usually book a “fancy” place to stay because all we really needed was a bed but, it was far more equipped for what we needed. But perfect for people who are staying there longer. Not to say it wasn’t good! It was the nicest place I’ve stayed in a long time. Thank you so much, also super clean everywhere ! Will be back <3"}
{"review_id":"1164384485265450571","date":"2024-05-25","comment":"Great location, staff really helpful and let us leave our bags to go into the city centre after we have checked out"}
{"review_id":"1189786922327947729","date":"2024-06-29","comment":"Whitworth Locke is such a stunning building. Everything is immaculate. Extremely impressed."}
{"review_id":"1215114468959574216","date":"2024-08-03","comment":"Beautfiul accommosation, in a great location, it's about a 15 minute walk to the main shopping precinct in Manchester, but the walk allong canal street is so beautiful and lively that you won't mind at all.\nIt also helps that one of the best coffee shops in Manchester is right down stairs"}
{"review_id":"1220936000012575208","date":"2024-08-11","comment":"Gorgeous building, lovely decor and cute rooms. Breakfast was good and most of the staff were lovely."}
{"review_id":"1239836312651853189","date":"2024-09-06","comment":"Excellent, clean, modern studio apartment in the centre of the city with everything that you could possibly need, including the most fabulous toiletries. I would recommend to everyone staying in Manchester."}
{"review_id":"1317358602791987962","date":"2024-12-22","comment":"10/10"}
