{"review_id":"1370324761514837703","date":"2025-03-05","comment":"Stayed here twice now and everything was as expected. Can’t go wrong with this place!"}
{"review_id":"1371704621526594013","date":"2025-03-07","comment":"My recent stay at the Whitworth Locke in Manchester was truly exceptional. From the moment I arrived, I was impressed by the hotel's attention to detail and commitment to guest comfort. The amenities were simply amazing, offering everything I could have asked for and more.\nMy room was beautiful, thoughtfully designed, and perfectly equipped for my trip. It felt like a home away from home, with everything I needed readily available.\nWhat truly set the Whitworth Locke apart was the incredible staff. They were consistently kind, welcoming, and incredibly accommodating, going above and beyond to ensure my stay was perfect. Their genuine warmth and helpfulness made a huge difference.\nI went into this stay with certain expectations, and the Whitworth Locke surpassed them in every way. If you're looking for a comfortable, stylish, and welcoming hotel in Manchester, I wholeheartedly recommend the Whitworth Locke."}
{"review_id":"1371782618542737052","date":"2025-03-07","comment":"We loved everything about this place! Most of all, the staff went above and beyond to make us feel at home. We will most definitely be back!"}
{"review_id":"1377529427148765319","date":"2025-03-15","comment":"We enjoyed our stay at Whitworth Locke, it was great for a weekend getaway. Lovely, clean room with everything you need for a comfortable stay."}
{"review_id":"1389846251622320752","date":"2025-04-01","comment":"Had a lovely stay at Whitworth Lock for a Monday Night gig, the entrance was lovely & the room was perfect for what we wanted! The staff were helpful and friendly and check in and check out was fast & efficient! Would recommend & would stay again!"}
{"review_id":"1433317775866076530","date":"2025-05-31","comment":"All good. The gym was a nice bonus."}
