{"review_id":"1496353825894792356","date":"2025-08-26","comment":"I only stayed for one night, but it was a really great experience! The place was clean, cozy, and had everything I needed for a comfortable stay. The host was friendly and helpful, making check-in smooth and easy. I used the co working space they had and it was a great experience. The location was convenient, and the little touches in the space made it feel welcoming. I’d definitely recommend it and would happily stay again."}
{"review_id":"1497046948024080951","date":"2025-08-27","comment":"Absolutely amazing! The apartment was clean and filled with everything required! Staff went above and beyond"}
