{"review_id":"1504272315283873603","date":"2025-09-06","comment":"Works like a hotel, had a restaurant and bar onsite- i didn't use them but they always looked full. Staff were friendly and easy to contact. The room was lovely very clean and provided everything they said it would"}
{"review_id":"1505724813076353476","date":"2025-09-08","comment":"I’ve stayed here the last 2 times I’ve been to Manchester because of how amazing the staff are and the location; easy to check in and they always offer luggage storage services plus are so friendly and accommodating! Cannot recommend enough :)"}
{"review_id":"1505755870980910647","date":"2025-09-08","comment":"We had a fantastic one-night stay here while visiting for a show at Castlefield Bowl. The apartment was exactly as described – really nice, beautifully decorated, and clean. It had all the basic essentials we needed for a short trip.\nThe location was perfect. We were able to walk everywhere easily: Castlefield Bowl, the Arndale shopping centre, and the Northern Quarter.\nThe check-in and checkout process was straightforward and easy. A special shout-out to Miriam on reception who was lovely, incredibly friendly, and provided brilliant customer service – she made us feel very welcome!\nWould definitely recommend and stay here again!"}
{"review_id":"1507251437702186181","date":"2025-09-10","comment":"Right in the heart of Manchester, so easy to walk around. Perfect for a short-term stay & loved the cafe downstairs!\nThe room was a bit warm with no Air con but otherwise 10/10"}
{"review_id":"1515883162462541664","date":"2025-09-22","comment":"Really good value for money, stunning rooms and perfect location. ⭐️"}
{"review_id":"1522446140181755210","date":"2025-10-01","comment":"We loved the atmosphere of Whitworth, with their bar services at night and coffee in the morning. Their staff were incredible. Only downside was the noise from the street until 1am."}
{"review_id":"1529676905474485965","date":"2025-10-11","comment":"Amazing stay. Super nice place and friendly team. Definitely will be back."}
{"review_id":"1544904557762274686","date":"2025-11-01","comment":"Very Good!"}
{"review_id":"1545711232668632155","date":"2025-11-02","comment":"Very friendly staff and excellent location"}
{"review_id":"1551450529208235377","date":"2025-11-10","comment":"Massive thank you to everyone at whitworth Locke, such beautiful place to stay and located so conveniently! It was so worth the money, I honestly would’ve paid more! The kitchen and utensils were spotless, the bathroom was fully stocked, the bed felt like I sleeping in a cloud, it was so soft! Tv was working great, everything was better than I could’ve imagined! There was also parking nearby (NPC Manchester Palace) but quite expensive *£23 for 24 hrs*\nOnly one area of critique; the key fob didn’t work for us so we had to replace it with another, this was a bit of hassle as we were carrying a few bags but they sorted it out very swiftly."}
{"review_id":"1560950270291230912","date":"2025-11-23","comment":"Parfait"}
{"review_id":"1568180085736738370","date":"2025-12-03","comment":"We had a wonderful stay at Whitworth Locke and that was largely to do with the helpful and attentive staff who made our time there very enjoyable and seamless with all questions and requests answered in a friendly and engaged manner. The location is perfect to wander and explore the city and within easy access to both the Piccadilly and Oxford Road train stations."}
{"review_id":"1571750015776731677","date":"2025-12-08","comment":"Great location, parking near by, hotel was lovely and the restaurant and bar looked lovely! Let us into the room half hour early which was amazing :) thank you!"}
{"review_id":"1572443612872781862","date":"2025-12-09","comment":"Really loved our stay here the place is gorgeous, bed super comfortable and location is central with access to all the shops and restaurants in Manchester. Walking distance from the train station too if you cut across the Gay Village. We had a great stay and would definitely love to come back. The coffee downstairs is amazing too!"}
{"review_id":"1573971313402868605","date":"2025-12-11","comment":"Great location for the city, nice room and staff down stairs. We really enjoyed it Thankyou."}
{"review_id":"1582696995368499802","date":"2025-12-23","comment":"We really enjoyed our stay at Whitworth Locke. Friendly staff, great location and the room was lovely. Great value and would definitely stay again(:!"}
