{"review_id":"1611676441209800536","date":"2026-02-01","comment":"Lovely hotel in the center of Manchester. Very helpful and kind staff at reception. Lovely vibes."}
{"review_id":"1615946252106202236","date":"2026-02-07","comment":"Whitworth Locke is now my top choice of places to stay when in Manchester. It’s minutes away from Oxford Road train station, across the road from the wonderful Canal Street and a 20 minute walk to the Northern Quarter of Manchester.\nThe room looks just like it does on the pictures. We only stayed for one night but we had an extremely comfortable stay. The studio room was great. The bed linen was luxurious, the bathroom was spotless and the kitchenette facilities were a bonus.\nThe staff on reception were super friendly and helpful. I’ll definitely be back. Thank you!"}
{"review_id":"1619571158670681330","date":"2026-02-12","comment":"Kindly hospitality"}
{"review_id":"1632707482394673449","date":"2026-03-02","comment":"Great place, easy to find, good access to the city centre"}
{"review_id":"1647170209272712992","date":"2026-03-22","comment":"A great location in central Manchester, walkable distance to everything you need. Amazing service from staff, they are extremely helpful and lovely. The room was a great size, spotless and had everything we needed."}
