{"review_id":"706336051376924428","date":"2022-09-01","comment":"Great"}
{"review_id":"757168539183411044","date":"2022-11-10","comment":"Really pleased with the room, facilities and cleanliness of the entire building.\nGood location for what/where we were after - good walking distance to everything and Ubers never too far away.\nCheck in information was really easy to follow.\nGood stay and would use again if we were to come back 👍🏼"}
{"review_id":"766487949550246158","date":"2022-11-23","comment":"Lovely little room"}
{"review_id":"769453707256123535","date":"2022-11-27","comment":"Lovely apartment, had everything we needed. Short distance to the arena. Free on street parking. Had a great stay thank you 😊"}
{"review_id":"799856429019353885","date":"2023-01-08","comment":"Perfect place for a first time in Manchester 15 minute walk from the city centre. Host provides easy to follow instructions for check in and check out."}
{"review_id":"804938150403682522","date":"2023-01-15","comment":"Great price great communication from the host and only £10 taxi from the city centre. Immediate surrounding it’s located it in self is a bit industrial but otherwise great stay."}
{"review_id":"819449269872578189","date":"2023-02-04","comment":"Needs a paint, but was exactly as described. Super close to the city centre."}
{"review_id":"822401826863521694","date":"2023-02-08","comment":"Thoroughly enjoyed our stay, apartment was exactly what was advertised, very spacious and clean perfect for our 4 day trip.The team at Pillo where also extremely helpful with answering any questions and providing us with a late checkout upon request. Location is great only a £6 taxi into the city centre, would definitley reccomend!"}
{"review_id":"870880933169313609","date":"2023-04-16","comment":"Accommodation was exactly as described. Communication was fantastic. I even changed the booking slightly the day before arrival, requesting a fourth person join us for the second night of the stay and it was very quickly agreed. If check out could have been midday, it would have been perfect. Will definitely recommend to others and will stay there again. Thank you"}
{"review_id":"891139838789450130","date":"2023-05-14","comment":"The apartment is as described and it was clean. The location within the city was a surprise - it would have been nice to have a head's up about that. Having to pay a security deposit is also additional hassle and I would prefer not to be required to do so."}
{"review_id":"902034820368958164","date":"2023-05-29","comment":"X"}
{"review_id":"911525761419557305","date":"2023-06-11","comment":"Prefect distance between from greater Manchester and Manchester Piccadilly"}
{"review_id":"915839383353156631","date":"2023-06-17","comment":"Good for a couple nights in Manchester, bit of a walk to city centre but the place itself felt very safe, incredibly clean"}
{"review_id":"920120375655038060","date":"2023-06-23","comment":"Really convenient for all Manchester attractions."}
{"review_id":"925944695005328850","date":"2023-07-01","comment":"Fin leilighet. Vær obs på at det er bare ett stort rom og åpen hems, som utgjør de to soverommene. Ligger litt avsides til, men fint å gå ca 15 min til sentrum. Verten gir tydelig info og det er fleksibel innsjekk. Anbefales."}
{"review_id":"926643848959817019","date":"2023-07-02","comment":"Perfect apartment for our stay! Comfortable beds / pillows."}
{"review_id":"928183098939337453","date":"2023-07-04","comment":"Pillo Rooms offered to us very clear instructions all the time and answered prontly our messages. The flat has everything we needed to be comfortable."}
{"review_id":"929543175635250450","date":"2023-07-06","comment":"Nice location just outside town centre and lovely accommodation clean and tidy would stay again"}
{"review_id":"930284029348289677","date":"2023-07-07","comment":"It was a beautiful apartment and quite easy to find. Big shops only 5 min walk away and bus stops that take you to the Center close by"}
{"review_id":"930997941512475989","date":"2023-07-08","comment":"윅칙는 좋직 않습닉닥. 근척엑 중동 삭람들익 많악석 늦은 식간엑는 낙각긱 억력울 것 같악욕. 극랙독 깩끅학곡 룸 컨딕션은 좋습닉닥. 많은 삭람들곽 쓱긱엑독 좋습닉닥."}
{"review_id":"934650889858351025","date":"2023-07-13","comment":"could have done with a tea towel on the kitchen, but overall, it was a great place to stay."}
{"review_id":"941946339729983928","date":"2023-07-23","comment":"Good place to stay at a reasonable price within walking distance of the city centre."}
{"review_id":"947733939997510268","date":"2023-07-31","comment":"Pillo room was spacious with most amenities needed! Good place to stay in Manchester!"}
{"review_id":"950655673572254630","date":"2023-08-04","comment":"Reasonable place organized by an institution, meaning they are less flexible than other airbnbs but professional.\nEchoing other reviews, take note of the location, deposit, and Accessibility notice.\nThis is overall a good and spacious place to stay :)"}
{"review_id":"952775802329663115","date":"2023-08-07","comment":"Clean and tidy , well equipped kitchen and power shower, lovely towels , fresh hotel quality linen on the beds and hairdryer and ironing board . Free parking outside. Perfect for our stay as we were at a wedding nearby."}
{"review_id":"955633286350693048","date":"2023-08-11","comment":"The overall quality of the appartment is ok. We missed some simple, basic material like a dishcloth. The location is near the center but in the middlle of an industrial area, quiet at night and particularly women may not feel safe walking alone in that area. The company did not release the exact address details till one day before checkin. The company ( not Airbnb ) also obliges you to make a security deposit before providing access code to the appartment. Lots of ( unnecessary ) communication, warning type of messages, a renting style I did not appreciate very much."}
{"review_id":"957075431767407083","date":"2023-08-13","comment":"This is a terrible place to stay. Be assured that the management's vocabulary has only one word \"No\"\nThey have all but 1 fan in a duplex apartment with 2 queen beds. How that logic works I fail to understand. Even the queen beds are smaller than size and thus 2 ppl cannot sleep on one bed. Apartment was like a furnace and the only fan was rotating and stopping at it's own will. Repeated requests to Pillo Rooms and Airbnb did not yield any result. Simply put these ppl have abt 8 apartments on the floor out of which 3 were occupied and they cld have easily gotten a fan from one of the vacant apartments and given to us. However, it seems they do not have any human near the premises to do that and they hid behind the excuse that all our apartments are rented at the moment.\nAll in all a very horrible experience. Pls rent out this place if u want to screw up u r vacation."}
{"review_id":"957173078365403825","date":"2023-08-13","comment":"It was clean and met our requirements! The Airbnb was situated in a great location really close to the city centre."}
{"review_id":"962869774365552055","date":"2023-08-21","comment":"The room was reasonably central and a cheap uber into the city. It had everything we needed and suited our needs. host was responsive communication was clear."}
{"review_id":"977459673122036572","date":"2023-09-10","comment":"Great price-quality value in a location within walking distance of centre."}
{"review_id":"980328746566411897","date":"2023-09-14","comment":"overall great stay, would stay again"}
{"review_id":"996316232596545347","date":"2023-10-06","comment":"Absolutely fab place would def stay again !"}
{"review_id":"1003528370315453024","date":"2023-10-16","comment":"Really great location, very clean and secure. Free parking was a bonus"}
{"review_id":"1004243544523553453","date":"2023-10-17","comment":"Pillo Rooms was a great option for our stay to attend a gig at the AO Arena given its location in north Manchester. Access was really efficient with key pad entry and lock box provided. Place was really clean and a good space with good amount of amenities and presented nicely. Would stay again."}
{"review_id":"1006420763848632727","date":"2023-10-20","comment":"Nice place for a short stay near the city. The area is very industrial so whilst walkable to the arena and the city centre it did not feel safe to do so after dark. The space was very comfortable, clean and had everything you’d need, except a tea towel!\nI booked this almost a year ago after snagging tickets for a gig. Since my booking Pillo rooms has partnered with a third party check in site, and requires an additional £99 deposit refundable within 14 days, or a £30 waiver. I felt that this was somewhat disingenuous as the listing on Airbnb had no mention of this at the time of booking. I have noticed that this is now mentioned in the listing.\nI’d stay again and budget for Ubers!"}
{"review_id":"1010803778245687762","date":"2023-10-26","comment":"Our experience at Pillo Rooms was an exceedingly average one. Location felt very unsafe as two young women - felt impossible to walk after dark. The hallway up to the flat was filthy with dust, grime and dirt - this is a problem of Pillo Room as they own the entire building. The carpet in the upstairs portion of the flat was stained, and the plastic covering to the boiler room was on the floor, giving an unsightly and unsettling view into the dark crawl space. Plates, cutlery and pots in the kitchen were dirty as we got them out. No kitchen basics, like salt and pepper. I was told there would be no personal message as to whether or not our deposit would be taken; we had to wait for an automated process. £99 is not a small amount of money to wait on! Disappointing.\nI would highly recommend that potential travellers book with an individual person rather than a company! They are always more flexible and accomodating. I would never stay with Pillo Rooms again!!"}
{"review_id":"1013705732579634189","date":"2023-10-30","comment":"Great location just 15mins walk from the AO arena, and as its in a mostly industrial location it was extremely quiet in an evening. The accommodation as per the listing, very clean, check in instructions clear, we would stay again"}
{"review_id":"1018046462194229323","date":"2023-11-05","comment":"A basic but very clean place to stay in Manchester."}
{"review_id":"1018812345204233716","date":"2023-11-06","comment":"Good apartment in a good location. Free on street parking and within easy walking distance into the city. Situated on an industrial estate, didn't feel very safe at first but it was absolutely fine. No problems at all."}
{"review_id":"1020216977135876158","date":"2023-11-08","comment":"Good stay"}
{"review_id":"1033207272653073159","date":"2023-11-26","comment":"Great value for money! Got a parking space outside directly under cctv camera. Basic but exactly what we needed. Great for a girls shopping trip. An Uber was 10 mins from the centre for £15"}
{"review_id":"1033232228827535167","date":"2023-11-26","comment":"The apartment was the same as photos and description. Had everything that was needed for our stay and fully equipped kitchen. Check in and out instructions were clear and host very quick to respond to any messages or questions."}
{"review_id":"1036874087568306502","date":"2023-12-01","comment":"The apartment was pleasant and well laid out, bed very comfortable.\nNot too far from the city centre, easy enough to walk (25 mins) or get a taxi in. Plenty of food places and grocery shops nearby.\nUnfortunately the radiator in the living/kitchen/dining area wasn’t working - cable had been cut!! - so I found it quite cold, especially as the sofa was near the large windows which made it feel colder. However I slept on the mezzanine level which was warm.\nThe apartment building is on an industrial area, surrounded by factory units - the plus side of this was evenings were quiet! Easy to park and my car was fine for the 3 nights I was there. I would stay again."}
{"review_id":"1038339941619740679","date":"2023-12-03","comment":"The airbnb is a short uber trip or 20 minute walk into Manchester. It is located on an industrial estate but was very quiet. Beds were comfy and overall not bad for the price paid. Carpets could do with a clean as quite stained."}
{"review_id":"1050665080942193331","date":"2023-12-20","comment":"Comfortable, good location for the concert and walking into the city. Really needs the walls washing/repainting and carpets to be cleaned - really let’s the place down. Other than that, would recommend and stay again the future providing the above was seen too."}
{"review_id":"1054973280013403834","date":"2023-12-26","comment":"The Host was very Responsive with the Instructions, the place was very likeable, had family dinner and everybody likes the place. Hopefully whenever I am visiting Manchester again it’s going to be available at all time. Looks home far from home."}
{"review_id":"1065106345893977605","date":"2024-01-09","comment":"Overall great stay was a lovely little apartment in a convenient location."}
{"review_id":"1109324815084571156","date":"2024-03-10","comment":"We enjoyed our stay here, was in a quiet area and easy enough to get to by walking or Uber. There were only a couple of wee things that could have improved our stay which was some of the glasses and small plates needed washed again before using and the rug in the living room area needed hoovered but everything else was clean and tidy. Easy instructions for getting into the place and into our room and we were able to get a late check out last minute which was great."}
{"review_id":"1114403977854069916","date":"2024-03-17","comment":"Accommodation was walkable distance into town, apartment was well maintained. Might be an idea to fit beside cabinets in your bedroom upstairs"}
{"review_id":"1119449958625556822","date":"2024-03-24","comment":"Check in process was very easy. The room was fine, definitely needs a repaint and pictures on walls. The location really wasn’t good, very industrial and had to taxi into the city. Very good value for what it is and if you don’t need to stay in the room during the day"}
{"review_id":"1120265460016369617","date":"2024-03-25","comment":"Convenient location. Worked well as a base for the weekend."}
