{"review_id":"1131114492173955021","date":"2024-04-09","comment":"Good location and easy to find. Good stay for weekend."}
{"review_id":"1132526998703343036","date":"2024-04-11","comment":"Loved the place and can’t wait to stay again"}
{"review_id":"1139803782276887330","date":"2024-04-21","comment":"Great room and very good value for money"}
{"review_id":"1152816377040019388","date":"2024-05-09","comment":"Lovely space indoors, clean and easy to check in."}
