{"review_id":"1195565519568701180","date":"2024-07-07","comment":"Nice place, off site check in requirements was arduous."}
{"review_id":"1215820995913016264","date":"2024-08-04","comment":"Beautiful Airbnb, great location and very quiet area"}
{"review_id":"1224596614878692772","date":"2024-08-16","comment":"Loved my stay at this property. I was in Manchester for work and this property is super close to all the warehouses."}
{"review_id":"1236152480612969978","date":"2024-09-01","comment":"Really enjoyed our stay here!\nEasy and very accessible location.\nCheck in and check out super smooth.\nApartment was very nice, cleaned bathroom and kitchen well equipped. Didn’t have any issues at all.\nDefinitely recommend this."}
{"review_id":"1249174459401043025","date":"2024-09-19","comment":"Parfait"}
{"review_id":"1249909531279617678","date":"2024-09-20","comment":"I would request everyone to not stay in this property, because they have helped the thief to steal my suitcase.\nAfter leaving Manchester, I had to stay in London for 4 days with only one pair of clothes left with me."}
{"review_id":"1251419477205393643","date":"2024-09-22","comment":"Great stay, fantastic weekend, advertised parking - managed to get a space but not a car park, area was in middle of industrial area, but the apartment itself cannot fault!"}
{"review_id":"1261545423796611685","date":"2024-10-06","comment":"Was a very good stay, advertisement matched the real thing."}
