{"review_id":"88997210","date":"2016-07-26","comment":"The place was absolutely great. Bathroom is nice and big too. Nicole is the perfect host. So welcoming and her knowledge of the local area is great as well. We would definitely stay again and we can't recommend Nicole and her place enough."}
{"review_id":"89844590","date":"2016-07-30","comment":"Very nice house, easy access to city center"}
{"review_id":"89880042","date":"2016-07-30","comment":"Nicole is such a lovely host - warm, chatty, and very knowledgeable about the local area! It was a pleasure to stay in such a nice house that was so convenient for both MediaCity and the city centre. I hope to stay with Nicole again!"}
{"review_id":"108741420","date":"2016-10-17","comment":"Nicole is friendly, her house is large and very close to bus station."}
{"review_id":"109555446","date":"2016-10-22","comment":"Lovely room in a very pleasant house. Nicole was great, very friendly and accommodating.\nWould definitely stay here again."}
{"review_id":"114557367","date":"2016-11-19","comment":"She was very welcoming. Talkative. Discribing."}
{"review_id":"127674022","date":"2017-01-20","comment":"Nicole was a super host with good information on the local area. Nice house and the room was perfect for my needs as was described."}
{"review_id":"129144347","date":"2017-01-29","comment":"Staying at Nicole’s place was absolutely perfect. There is nothing to complain about. I can really recommend her!"}
{"review_id":"129894661","date":"2017-02-03","comment":"Nicole's place is at the heart of Manchester public transport, it can be reached by most of the metro link lines just in a few stops.\nIt's also a short walk from Old Trafford for sports lovers.\nThe house is clean and well decorated, and Nicole is always there to help should you have any enquiries.\nI would highly recommend her place."}
{"review_id":"159956546","date":"2017-06-12","comment":"Really nice house and Nicole was lovely.\n7 min walk to tram which takes 5 mins into city centre!\nRoom was quite small but very nice. It does get very hot but a fan was provided. The pillows weren't very comfortable and were thin, but bed was very comfy!\nThere are two bathrooms in the house, so if there is other people staying it isn't private unfortunately. Was inconvenient the main shower was down 2 flights of stairs, otherwise you have to shower sat down in a bath.\nGreat for a short stay and if you aren't staying in much!"}
{"review_id":"161025720","date":"2017-06-16","comment":"Excellent, modern house, 10 minutes from the Metrolink into town. Lovely large room, kitchen to use and 3 bathrooms makes for an easy start to the day. Nicole's description is bang on, but Air BnB's indication pre-booking is rather off - as described it's 10 minutes walk southeast of the Cornbrook Metro stop in Stretford...which is really easy and cheap into town. A great choice in Manchester - so book early!"}
{"review_id":"167226132","date":"2017-07-06","comment":"Nicole was always quick to respond when I first made inquiries about her place and was really helpful with answering any queries I had about getting around Manchester, which made me decide to book a 3-night stay with her. But about a few weeks before my check-in date, I wrote her again to notify her of my arrival time, however she did not respond. And I still didn't hear from her right up to my day of arrival. Even after getting a local SIM card to call and text, I wasn't able to get through to her. Needless to say, I was pretty worried but still decided to head to her flat because she had always been responsive. I stood outside her flat for a good 10-15 minutes, ringing her bell and calling her mobile before she finally came to the door - just when I was about to leave.\nApart from this episode, which I'm sure was a one-off, Nicole's place was just as described. I was able to get around conveniently on both the tram and buses. And could come home to a hot shower and get a good rest every night. The kitchen was also free to use, but I was hardly around to cook.\nI didn't get a chance to see her much after the first day but thank you Nicole, for making my first stay in Manchester feel so warm and welcoming, despite the initial hiccup (:"}
{"review_id":"168814174","date":"2017-07-10","comment":"A lovely house, clean, bright with bus stop and tram around. Really close to the city center and not far of Salford university. Amazing host, nice and friendly. She came to pick me up when I was lost in the city. I'm not disappointed at all. I highly recommend!"}
{"review_id":"173025557","date":"2017-07-22","comment":"All her reviews are true - Nicole was lovely, accomodating, the bed was comfortable, the shower deliciously hot. Very LGBT friendly - something i worry about staying with strangers. We were a pretty last minute booking as well but Nicole was lovely about this and a couple of hiccups. A little further out of town than we expected, but very regular buses from the end of the road and Ubers are cheap. Would stay again!"}
{"review_id":"174924381","date":"2017-07-27","comment":"A really lovely place with a great host."}
{"review_id":"214990784","date":"2017-11-27","comment":"Necole is a outstanding life artist. She is always enjoying to create something in her life. Of course, painting art is her favorite. Living and taking with her, you will feel happy and enjoying your life with her. This house is new and location also is good and quiet. I love it."}
{"review_id":"230862801","date":"2018-01-29","comment":"Nicole is an amazing person, she was always very kind, she even stayed awake late and waited for us on the arrival day. The place is beautiful and close to the center (about 20 min by walk). We are glad we've chosen this accomodation."}
{"review_id":"253067476","date":"2018-04-13","comment":"Very good place to stay."}
{"review_id":"253851793","date":"2018-04-15","comment":"Very nice apparment. Good location to walk into the city center or to Old Trafford. The host is super nice and gave me some milk for my cereals and good sightseeing advise. Would visit again!"}
{"review_id":"274472297","date":"2018-06-09","comment":"Nice and cozy stay"}
{"review_id":"276648178","date":"2018-06-14","comment":"Great place, clean, modern and spacious. Nicole was away when I stayed but her friend was staying over and was warm and welcoming."}
{"review_id":"281680491","date":"2018-06-25","comment":"La habitación está muy bien cama cómoda, baño limpio privado todo nuevo excelente.. la cocina bien y la ubicación si vas a old trafford genial.. sino alejada del centro. Nicole me indicó como llegar y obtener llaves.. y prácticamente estuve sólo. La vi una vez charlamos muy amable y luego me maneje por mis medios. Muy simpática"}
{"review_id":"284192549","date":"2018-07-01","comment":"Nicole’s home is lovely and bright, it is beautifully decorated and there’s artworks everywhere. The location is as she described 7-10 minutes south of Cornbrook tram station (airbnb’s location prediction is not correct), from where you can get into the city centre within 5 minutes. There are also bus stops near the house, or if you fancy a walk it takes about 20-30 minutes into the city centre.\nI didn’t see much of Nicole but had some chats with her lovely flatmates and Nicole responded quickly to messages when I was staying with her.\nWould recommend this place for anyone who wants to stay in Manchester and prefers a residential area."}
{"review_id":"285649027","date":"2018-07-04","comment":"clean and worthy"}
{"review_id":"325354175","date":"2018-09-19","comment":"방이 예쁘고 깨끗해요. 그리고 침대가 넓고 푹신해서 좋습니다! 화장실 겸 욕실도 방 바로 옆이라 이용하기 편리하고 옆 방 게스트와 함께 썼던 것 같은데 그 분이 너무 조용하시고 한 번도 안마주쳐서 마치 혼자 쓰는 듯한 엄청난 편안함을 가졌습니다. 위치는 올드트래포드랑도 걸어서 40분 맨체스커 시내랑도 걸어서 40분으로 약간 삼각형이라 둘 다 애매하게 먼듯 가까운 듯 그렇습니다. 버스나 트램도 다니는 것 같은데 저는 다 걸어다녔기때문에 좀 애매했습니다. 그래도 이 가격에 이런 환경의 숙소라면 추천해요! 댜먄 여쟈 횬쟈 저녁에 숙소 챶아오기 죰 뮤셔워요. 참고하세요!"}
{"review_id":"330071393","date":"2018-09-30","comment":"Nicole is a very kind and open host, giving lots of tipps on stuff to do. The room I stayed in was very clean and comfy and the kitchen and living room are free to use as well which is the greatest benefit! I felt very welcome and had a lovely time staying and bus service is very well in that area with three different routes going into the city centre."}
