{"review_id":"443592038","date":"2019-04-26","comment":"Nicole is a lovely host and her place is super clean in a great location. Definitely recommend."}
{"review_id":"452559613","date":"2019-05-13","comment":"Nicole’s place was clean and well kept. Walkable distance from everything, but can also use the tram to get into the city as the nearest stop is just 10 minutes away. Nicole allowed me to use her kitchen which was great as it allowed me to save a bit of money."}
{"review_id":"469751176","date":"2019-06-15","comment":"I highly recommend Nicole’s townhouse as a place to stay while exploring Manchester. Nicole is great, hands-off host. It’s in a safe neighborhood and a nice, leisurely walk into the city. The price for the location is great. I will be back. Thanks, Nicole!"}
{"review_id":"471417530","date":"2019-06-17","comment":"Nicole place was great. If you are visiting the Old Trafford Stadium, a 8 minute walk from the nearest metrolink and the stadium a 5 minute Uber ride. The shower area and bedroom was very neat and spotless. Cozy room on another floor with lot of privacy. Great communication and very welcoming with the english tea."}
{"review_id":"472725565","date":"2019-06-20","comment":"The house is very nice and stylish. The room is very clean. The location is near the city; a five minutes walk to the nearby tram station. There's free street parking outside the house on a quiet street. Check-in is very easy via keypad and the host responds promptly on queries. Five stars."}
{"review_id":"478085736","date":"2019-06-29","comment":"Nicole heeft me een keurige kamer verhuurd met gebruik van keuken en huiskamer. Ze gaf me het gevoel dat ze me zonder meer vertrouwde en ikvond haar een prettig mens . Ik kom graag weer."}
{"review_id":"483074564","date":"2019-07-07","comment":"This place is clean, comfortable and has easy access to most places in Manchester especially the sporting venues. Nicole is a super gracious host and her suggestions for things to do around Manchester were spot on. I would highly recommend this place."}
{"review_id":"485111139","date":"2019-07-10","comment":"Nicole's place is Top Notch especially if u r a sports Fan n visiting Old Trafford or the Football\nIts within walking distance from.everything\nNicole is accommodating friendly and made me feel.very welcome\nI highly recommend her place to all who want to visit Manchester\nThank You Nicole"}
