{"review_id":"768711968639437079","date":"2022-11-26","comment":"I stayed here a week and everything was excellent. The house was easy to find from the instructions and about a 10 minute walk from the Cornbrook tram stop. Neighborhood is safe and quiet. The city center is only a few stops away on the tram. I couldn't have asked for anything better. The room was clean, cozy, and comfy and the bathroom and kitchen were kept spotless. Nicole checked in with me frequently but allowed me my independence. She was really communicative as well. She and her partner were so lovely to chat with too. I was made to feel right at home. Excellent hospitality. I would definitely recommend her place, and I would definitely stay here again!"}
{"review_id":"777466551213839664","date":"2022-12-08","comment":"Nicole was a very friendly host with a tidy, cozy, stylish place. Great location within walking distance of trams to all over Manchester."}
{"review_id":"808524197765727216","date":"2023-01-20","comment":"It is a clean room, Nicole is so friendly, approximately 30 mins to city center on foot but cornbrook tram station is 8 mins on foot and you can go everywhere by tram."}
{"review_id":"826741335974677799","date":"2023-02-14","comment":"Had a great, cozy stay. The internet is good, nice clean bathroom, equipped kitchen. Good location. The room isn't big but there's plenty of storage in the large drawers under the bed and bedside cabinet.\nNicole and her partner were very friendly and approachable. Would definitely recommend!"}
