{"review_id":"857872994678823146","date":"2023-03-29","comment":"Amazing Host friendly kind and felt like home . 10/10 Will book here if I'm coming back to manchester.\nSo many bus stops close by takes to every location in manchester. co op store in 10 min walk for groceries.Room and toilets were accurate as shown in the pictures .cleaning done once a week"}
