{"review_id":"1347051600313094660","date":"2025-02-01","comment":"I stayed for a little over 5 months. Nicole and Andrew made me feel at home from the first day. They gave me very good recommendations and were always attentive to help me with everything I needed. I never had any problems. THE BEST. Additionally, the house is very well located, close to everything, super comfortable and beautiful. I would always visit them again."}

