{"review_id":"1672437037069052734","date":"2026-04-26","comment":"We stayed for one evening for a concert and it did the job as we literally just slept there and the accommodation was close to a tram stop and one stop to Victoria station. I wouldn’t advise that if you are alone though as the area was a little rough.\nOlu was lovely, greeted us and was very helpful.\nHowever the accommodation was a little dated and could do with a fresh lick of paint. There was also rather a lot of cobwebs at the top of the stairs and was also a cooking smell due to host living downstairs.\nAlso I’m not sure if I read it wrong or it doesn’t state that there is a third room and someone may be staying there and it’s all an open space.\nI hadn’t realised there was anyone staying there too and didn’t lock up our belongings and only realised this on getting ready to check out. However had I have realised this I would have been a little more careful as they can just get into our rooms as all the area is shared."}
{"review_id":"1530454132340983834","date":"2025-10-12","comment":"Nice place with a very pleasant and helpful host. Facilities were very adequate for our 1 night stay in Manchester area. Fairly close to the city centre with easy taxi ride"}
{"review_id":"1245580647460549285","date":"2024-09-14","comment":"Olu is a good and friendly host. We arrived late, but he was okay with that. The house was clean and felt like home."}
{"review_id":"1281830924837974385","date":"2024-11-03","comment":"Would definiely use again for affordable, clean and comfy overnight stay. Only a short taxi ride to AO arena where we were going. Olu was a pleasant and attentive host"}
{"review_id":"1429633380281732653","date":"2025-05-26","comment":"Olu was nice and very welcoming person. The check-in was smooth and the bathroom is super clean."}
{"review_id":"1713032438542209021","date":"2026-06-21","comment":"Nice clean rooms, easy access and Olu was really nice and welcoming. Would stay there again"}
{"review_id":"1441973988109302509","date":"2025-06-12","comment":"lovely lace and great host."}
{"review_id":"1252119436258794575","date":"2024-09-23","comment":"Olu was very friendly and his place did the job. Decent location and the accommodation itself was fine as well since we only used it to sleep at. Thanks Olu!"}
{"review_id":"1587757986178655985","date":"2025-12-30","comment":"Olu offered even us a ride to the supermarket. Such a guy. Olu is one of the reason life is worth living ngl"}
{"review_id":"1473860152548888214","date":"2025-07-26","comment":"Olu was an amazing host, he went above and beyond for me during my stay even dropped me off at the arena for the show that i was attending. Was so helpful and kind i couldn’t recommend this place any more! Will definitely be staying again"}
{"review_id":"1594178791241320897","date":"2026-01-08","comment":"We had a great stay at this place. The host was very responsive and made check-in easy. The apartment was clean, comfortable, and exactly as described. I would definitely recommend staying here."}
{"review_id":"1464453317872985527","date":"2025-07-13","comment":"Estuvimos como en casa! Olu es muy simpático y agradable y su alojamiento es tal cual se anuncia. En tram o bus es muy fácil y rápido llegar al centro de la ciudad. Gracias por alojarnos, Olu!"}
{"review_id":"1565230925313591554","date":"2025-11-29","comment":"todo bien, solo echamos un poco en falta tener un supermercado más cerca."}
{"review_id":"1279724203182135848","date":"2024-10-31","comment":"Old is very kind and helpful. He is willing to answer my every enquiry."}
{"review_id":"1697868468435829130","date":"2026-05-31","comment":"Friendly and helpful host.Easy to find."}
{"review_id":"1680502587701100508","date":"2026-05-07","comment":"was great distance from the co op live.\nBed was clean and comfortable\nI would stay again\nA little WD40 is needed on the doors as very squeaky. Got back late and didn't want to be noisy but couldn't help the squeaky door."}
{"review_id":"1362980784614131851","date":"2025-02-23","comment":"Very spacious and well equipped. The main door is their front door so they have access to all the rooms but the bedrooms have locks on. Perfect location for the Coop Area as it is only 1.3 miles away and we walked back after the gig."}
{"review_id":"1265835507334724881","date":"2024-10-12","comment":"Really nice and a good place to stay"}
{"review_id":"1579746906554964886","date":"2025-12-19","comment":"A nice little warm home from home, with an extremely comfy bed.\nOlu is a very friendly outgoing host and eager to please.\nI would definitely stay again if the chance arose."}
{"review_id":"1678329146727350827","date":"2026-05-04","comment":"The room was generally clean and well-maintained, and the check-in and check-out instructions were clear and easy to follow, which made the stay convenient. However, there was unexpected noise from another guest staying in the third bedroom, which did affect the overall comfort.\nIt’s a good option for those travelling by car, especially in Manchester where accommodation with free parking can be limited, so this was a definite plus."}
{"review_id":"1671737488958756980","date":"2026-04-25","comment":"Stayed at Olu's place to attend a concert at Coop Live. Olu sent clear instructions and a video in advance of check in. He popped by to say hello and was very friendly and helpful. the location was perfect and the rooms very clean. We'd definitely stay here again."}
{"review_id":"1434065058245510587","date":"2025-06-01","comment":"Todo estuvo perfecto Olu es muy atento y el alojamiento estába en buenas condiciones y limpio barrio tranquilo un gran lugar para hospedarse"}
{"review_id":"1337634416534919913","date":"2025-01-19","comment":"Very clean rooms, close to the city centre and peaceful. Thank you Olu!"}
{"review_id":"1616703467440341126","date":"2026-02-08","comment":"Was perfect for our weekend away. Everything as described. Clear instructions. Thank you so much!"}
{"review_id":"1692007425352604906","date":"2026-05-23","comment":"I enjoyed my stay at this wonderful Airbnb, neatly dressed and comfortable. I would recommend this place for anyone who is coming nearby.\nThanks Mr. Olu."}
{"review_id":"1518767602759281484","date":"2025-09-26","comment":"Nice and friendly, showed us all the rooms himself and said if there was anything else we needed."}
{"review_id":"1495632599532926733","date":"2025-08-25","comment":"The shower is quite challenging with unstable temperatures. The host Olu is super nice and responsive. I left my Apple EarPod under the pillow when checked out. Olu got in touch with us and offered to ship it to our hotel for free. Quite touchy!"}
{"review_id":"1515144341673713690","date":"2025-09-21","comment":"Absolutely perfect place for a concert at Co-op Live, walking distance but also far away enough that there's very little noise.\nHouse is lovely, everything in great condition and very clean. Olu is incredibly welcoming, friendly and very helpful - cannot recommend this place enough!"}
{"review_id":"1342717236133952862","date":"2025-01-26","comment":"A nice stay, perfect distance for a trip to a Man City game."}
{"review_id":"1611624851106495946","date":"2026-02-01","comment":"A very welcoming place, clean and convenient. Very pleased with the experience"}
{"review_id":"1708047902578423204","date":"2026-06-14","comment":"it was very lovely and a great place to put your stuff if you're partying in Manchester"}
{"review_id":"1484714337288617317","date":"2025-08-10","comment":"Good value for money, would definitely stay again"}
{"review_id":"1405045444356019231","date":"2025-04-22","comment":"Nice clean place, and good host. He was very responsive even at late hours."}
{"review_id":"1291990168034615947","date":"2024-11-17","comment":"Olu's place has nice ambience, the rooms are tastefully decorated and have everything you need. Check-in instructions were very clear. While in the area, pop by the Museum of Transport nearby, it's a local gem."}
{"review_id":"1346365158235925447","date":"2025-01-31","comment":"Everything was as described, easy to check in and out and a great price"}
{"review_id":"1233245423905945291","date":"2024-08-28","comment":"Nice stay with family. Olu was super supportive.\nGreatly appreciate."}
{"review_id":"1345696841417392659","date":"2025-01-30","comment":"Heel enthousiaste host, niets op aan te merken. Wel afgelegen van alles en wat aan de kleine kant. Wel enorm genoten van het verblijf"}
{"review_id":"1446319908568435269","date":"2025-06-18","comment":"Olu has to be the friendliest host we have ever had the pleasure to meet, if you book with him you will not be disappointed. I highly recommend him 👍🏼"}
{"review_id":"1713735051667070207","date":"2026-06-22","comment":"Great location for concert at Etihad. Olu was lovely and happy to help. I'd stay again. Thank you!"}
{"review_id":"1636281937758252970","date":"2026-03-07","comment":"We stayed for one night in two rooms and were very happy with the airbnb! We went to an event at Coop Live and it was within walking distance. Also well connected to the city center. Overall nice stay and would recommend! :)"}
{"review_id":"1524625944893174804","date":"2025-10-04","comment":"Olu was very helpful & friendly. TV in the bedroom didn’t work but Olu tried to fix it. Rooms priced well but do need some refreshing in the near future. A good first Air bnb experience. Thank you."}
{"review_id":"1471689341558652286","date":"2025-07-23","comment":"Very friendly host, you really need to meet him. Whenever you need him, he will always be there."}
{"review_id":"1544962512797472563","date":"2025-11-01","comment":"Great for coop live.. as only £ 5 uber to get to concert . easy to find parking available on street or use of driveway was an option shower gel & towels available, comfy beds. warm rooms . Olu great and called to meet us . shared kitchen but we didn't need really as only needed somewhere to stay close by ."}
{"review_id":"1474633923616103931","date":"2025-07-27","comment":"Olu was a lovely host and made us feel very comfortable. The place was walking distance from Co-op live arena, which is great if you’re in Manchester for a concert (like us)"}
{"review_id":"1479721085713216873","date":"2025-08-03","comment":"It was a nice place , the girls had fun"}
{"review_id":"1469528429532677072","date":"2025-07-20","comment":"Easy and smooth check in. Peaceful area with good connections to the city. Host was friendly and polite throughout. Thanks ☺️"}
{"review_id":"1687725383392717290","date":"2026-05-17","comment":"Der Zugang zur Unterkunft war einfach und wurde zuvor klar beschrieben.\nBein Öffnen der Tür haben wir gleich einen unangenehmen Geruch festgestellt. Es roch nach Plastik und altem Staub. Dies war auch im oberen Stockwerk so.\nInsgesamt war es sehr staubig, dreckig, der Teppich vorm Bett war fleckig und verschmutzt. Die Nachtkonsole, der Tisch und selbst die Wände waren fleckig und verdreckt. Die Wände hatten Löcher, als hätte jemand gegen die Wand geschlagen.\nIm Bad lagen Haare in der Dusche, die Toilette war nicht sauber und überall waren Zahnpastaflecken.\nDie Küche sah auch nicht besser aus. Die Mikrowelle war verschmutzt, von innen wie von außen.\nAlle Zimmertüren quietschen extrem.\nWir waren froh nur eine Nacht dort verbracht zu haben und sind relativ zeitig am nächsten Morgen abgereist."}
{"review_id":"1409361979436305929","date":"2025-04-28","comment":"Nice and cosy place, just one stop from Manchester city centre via tram which was pretty convenient. Responsive Host with flexibility on check out time:)"}
{"review_id":"1248538700960349669","date":"2024-09-18","comment":"I Enjoyed my…. Mr Olu was a great host"}
{"review_id":"1540594357575777196","date":"2025-10-26","comment":"Oli ist sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit"}
{"review_id":"1677538862623504153","date":"2026-05-03","comment":"Such a lovely home and a very friendly host, Olu was more than happy to help when we couldn’t figure out how to open the lock box (it’s actually very easy 😅) and was really nice when we checked out. The house was spotless and the bedrooms were really comfy and spacious, i’d absolutely recommend this place!"}
{"review_id":"1236130627762366434","date":"2024-09-01","comment":"I cannot thank Olu enough for his gracious hospitality. From the very beginning he has been extremely helpful and totally respected my privacy. I cannot recommend this accommodation enough. Thank you Olu you’re the best. God bless!"}
{"review_id":"1297112653012187869","date":"2024-11-24","comment":"너무 좋았고 호스트가 너무 친절했어요"}
{"review_id":"1565945532533149302","date":"2025-11-30","comment":"Stayed for event at Co Op. not too far for location however in a rough area and a lot smaller than expected. But very basic for a quick last min one night stay"}

