{"review_id":"1636971809543791501","date":"2026-03-08","comment":"we have stayed at this place before when it was the guinea pig hotel, great flat, great location as well. the sofa bed is a bit uncomfortable so maybe better for a 2 staying rather than a 3 or 4 and can hear the noise from the main street. but overall a fantastic place and we will definitely stay again."}
{"review_id":"1554345204613118473","date":"2025-11-14","comment":"Great place to stay. Love the trucks and sandpit - lovely little touch! Quite a quirky and cool place! Would highly recommend."}
