{"review_id":"1693522777203658742","date":"2026-05-25","comment":"Lovely flat and great communication made for a stress free stay."}
{"review_id":"1569548400577011997","date":"2025-12-05","comment":"Great place to stay and great host. Would highly recommend"}
{"review_id":"1484733095123629359","date":"2025-08-10","comment":"Lovely stay, had a great time with the kids"}
{"review_id":"1525392121019032987","date":"2025-10-05","comment":"Lovely place, enjoyed our stay, would stay again"}
{"review_id":"1377477057009126785","date":"2025-03-15","comment":"He is very responsible and support, such as early check in and real extension of the stay. He is very kind and supportive. We enjoyed the property!!"}
{"review_id":"1555838136040049230","date":"2025-11-16","comment":"Great thank you"}
{"review_id":"1542730508826130713","date":"2025-10-29","comment":"Clean and spacious flat in a central location.\nQuirky decor and comfortable bed."}
{"review_id":"1677579409042920305","date":"2026-05-03","comment":"Super"}
{"review_id":"1593495108357984244","date":"2026-01-07","comment":"This was a great base for visiting family in the area. Close to town for shopping, restaurants etc (though we didn't need to use these on this trip). A big fridge freezer is great for self catering. Lounge area spacious and comfortable (though again we didn't spend much time there on this visit). Quirkiness of flat decor is a 'nice to have'.\nMatthew was very responsive in the lead up to the visit - flexible, communicative & reassuring as our plans changed from day to day at times! Also good to get a message from him after a day or so, checking if all was ok.\nWe did report some trouble with the radiators, which may just have needed bleeding; the road noise wasn't as muffled by the double glazing as we'd have hoped, but it is a major road and so hard to avoid; the only other issue was the sloping ceiling above the bath/shower which is a bit awkward if you're tall!\nBut none of these was a big problem in an otherwise very comfortable, practical and pleasant flat. Thanks, Matthew."}
{"review_id":"1664480130715921404","date":"2026-04-15","comment":"Nice apartment 👍🏼"}
{"review_id":"1652189651585503288","date":"2026-03-29","comment":"This was a great flat for us for our short stay as it was only a two minute walk from our son’s place, fortunately we were able to park at our son’s too as there were a few restrictions nearby. The flat itself was lovely and the decor made it feel very homely and welcoming. Our dog settled right in and there was a small green space nearby for late night, early morning toileting. We highly recommend staying here and we will definitely be booking again"}
{"review_id":"1386890150695099430","date":"2025-03-28","comment":"Nice flat and very communicative host but unfortunately the place is ruined by the very loud street outside directly next to the bedroom. I’m a deep sleeper but was woken up throughout each night by cars, bikes and loud people."}
{"review_id":"1409385329827943562","date":"2025-04-28","comment":"We had the best stay at Matthew’s! Thank you for being a great host!!!!"}
{"review_id":"1489819413564043886","date":"2025-08-17","comment":"very friendly host and very clean"}
{"review_id":"1672509982048884321","date":"2026-04-26","comment":"We had a great time! The flat is lovely"}
{"review_id":"1549356848925906278","date":"2025-11-07","comment":"Comfortable stay in a lovely home. Hosts were very friendly and helpful"}
{"review_id":"1615242221146911625","date":"2026-02-06","comment":"this is my second stay at Matthew's ......an absolute splendid stay as usual. I absolute love the place,feels like home.\nAnd Mathew is always quick to respond.\nI highly highly recommend."}
{"review_id":"1566028808008855476","date":"2025-11-30","comment":"Absolutely clean house, everything was spot on. Felt like home. I enjoyed my stay."}
{"review_id":"1713612218098732786","date":"2026-06-22","comment":"Real cozy place half an hour (train) from Manchester"}
{"review_id":"1406542513987518617","date":"2025-04-24","comment":"Matthew’s place worked well for us. As previous reviewers have commented the flat is on a main road so it is noisy but we still slept well!"}
